        "imageUrl": "https://cf.bstatic.com/xdata/images/hotel/max1024x768/165429498.jpg?k=1bf03671945db9a05c3f3b63ba0db9da600c6c49b43391b411cf62250d7b97a8&o=",
        "imageUrl2": "https://cf.bstatic.com/xdata/images/hotel/max500/165428844.jpg?k=c616b2842271787944b173500a881133df814279c24815b302d4cee39ff22f9a&o=",
        "description_fr": "Veuillez noter que le linge de lit, les serviettes et le ménage de fin de séjour ne sont pas inclus dans le tarif des cottages, des maisons de vacances, des chambres quadruples, des chambres familiales et des dortoirs. \nL’utilisation de linge, de drap de voyage ou de sac de couchage est obligatoire pour des raisons d’hygiène. Vous pourrez louer du linge de maison sur place ou apporter le vôtre.\nVeuillez noter que la location des équipements doit être réservée à l’avance à l’adresse e-mail suivante : abisko.butik@stfturist.se.\nVeuillez noter que de mi-avril à mi-juin et de fin septembre à mi-novembre, l'établissement propose des services limités. Le service de restauration est assuré tous les jours pour le petit-déjeuner ainsi que le déjeuner et le dîner avec un menu bistro.",
        "description_en": "Please note that bedlinen, towels and departure cleaning are not included in the rate of Cottages, Holiday homes, Quadruple rooms, Family rooms and dorm beds. \nThe usage of linen, travel sheet or sleeping bag is mandatory due to hygienic reasons. Linen is either rented on site or you can bring your own.\nKindly observe that equipment rental must be pre booked on abisko.butik@stfturist.se.\nPlease note that from mid April to mid June and end September to mid November the property offers slightly reduced services. Restaurant service is up and running daily with breakfast, lunch and evening Bistro menu as well as a convenience store. Aurora Sky Station along with the chair lift on Mount Nuolja is closed.",
        "description_es": "La ropa de cama, las toallas y la limpieza de final de estancia no están incluidas en el precio de las casas de campo, casas, habitaciones cuádruples, habitaciones familiares ni camas compartidas. \nEl uso de ropa de cama, sábanas de viaje o sacos de dormir es obligatorio por razones higiénicas. Podrá traer su propia ropa de cama y toallas o alquilarlas en el establecimiento.\nEl alquiler debe solicitarse con antelación a través de la dirección de correo abisko.butik@stfturist.se.\nDesde mediados de abril hasta mediados de junio y desde finales de septiembre hasta mediados de noviembre, el establecimiento ofrece servicios ligeramente reducidos. El servicio de restaurante funciona todos los días y ofrece un menú bistrot para el desayuno, el almuerzo y la cena, así como una tienda.",
        "description_pt": "Please note that bedlinen, towels and departure cleaning are not included in the rate of Cottages, Holiday homes, Quadruple rooms, Family rooms and dorm beds. \nThe usage of linen, travel sheet or sleeping bag is mandatory due to hygienic reasons. Linen is either rented on site or you can bring your own.\nKindly observe that equipment rental must be pre booked on abisko.butik@stfturist.se.\nPlease note that from mid April to mid June and end September to mid November the property offers slightly reduced services. Restaurant service is up and running daily with breakfast, lunch and evening Bistro menu as well as a convenience store. Aurora Sky Station along with the chair lift on Mount Nuolja is closed.",
        "description_it": "La tariffa dei cottage, delle case vacanza, delle camere quadruple, delle camere familiari e dei dormitori non include la biancheria da letto, gli asciugamani e la pulizia di fine soggiorno. \nPer motivi igienici è obbligatorio l’uso di biancheria, di lenzuola da viaggio o di un sacco a pelo. Potrete noleggiare la biancheria in loco oppure portarla da casa.\nIl noleggio deve essere prenotato in anticipo scrivendo ad abisko.butik@stfturist.se.\nDa metà aprile a metà giugno e da fine settembre a metà novembre la struttura offre servizi leggermente ridotti. Troverete aperti tutti i giorni il minimarket in loco e il ristorante, che offre colazione, pranzo e menù bistrot serale. L'Aurora Sky Station e la seggiovia del Monte Nuolja sono chiuse.",
